            <article class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" type="button">Do you do software houses?<span class="plus">+</span></button><div class="faq-a">Yes. Focus first, culture second. 60% focus 30% collaboration 10% refuge — focus vs collaboration — demo room for clients — breakout gaming for retention. Named outputs: plan, stills, BOQ if you want site.</div></article>
