            <article class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" type="button">What is fit-out at Woodex?<span class="plus">+</span></button><div class="faq-a">Two routes: Woodex-designed, or your drawings (we review first). You approve the scope in writing, then the site. Civil MEP joinery furniture — ISO 9001 — mill connected to still.</div></article>
